# A task opened from the Tasks view: @Kai's chat shows only the turns that answered it and its desk
# only the pages opened for it, and Whole chat widens both again.
stage 1440 900
window 1440 900
prefer themeId aura-noir
replies task-flow.json
project storefront shop-site
chat Jeice
title "Pay button in Safari"
chat Kai
title "Storefront"
settle 4
say "Pay button on the invoice does nothing in Safari. No spinner, nothing in the console. The cart's checkout works fine."
hold 14
say "Search puts sold-out items first"
hold 8
front Kai
settle 3
snap whole-before
task "Pay button on the invoice"
settle 4
snap task
task whole
settle 4
snap whole
